  "nodes": [
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "d7ba00af68ff685f",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-left, cc-border-right, cc-border-dashed\n---\n\n# Lesson 4: Using multiple decorations in one card",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 700,
      "x": -600,
      "y": -400
    },
    {
      "height": 340,
      "id": "d16cf350c91221d5",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\nIn many cases, more than one decoration can be combined into a card. For example, perhaps you want a card with a dotted border, the border to be orange color, but don't want any background color in the card. For this we need to do the following:\n1. Draw a card on the canvas\n2. Set the color to orange\n3. Add two cssclasses:\n\t1. `cc-border-double`\n\t2. `cc-card-nocolor`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 700,
      "x": -600,
      "y": -320
    },
    {
      "height": 310,
      "id": "108b2b93b24c6194",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\nThe following card is identical to the previous, with the two decorations, however now, we have added a 3rd decoration to add a drop shadow. This decoration is: `cc-dropshadow`. Double-click the card to examine it's contents.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 298,
      "x": -600,
      "y": 130
    },
    {
      "height": 170,
      "id": "02680243a7aeb008",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\nHere is what this card will look like with multiple decorations. Go ahead and double-click the card to see the contents of the card.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 260,
      "x": -600,
      "y": -55
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 110,
      "id": "6c7f59cd060bbcca",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-double, cc-card-nocolor\n---\n\nHELLO WORLD\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 215,
      "x": -262,
      "y": -35
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 129,
      "id": "b4dcce528df0a517",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-double, cc-card-nocolor, cc-border-dropshadow\n---\n\nHELLO WORLD",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 215,
      "x": -262,
      "y": 156
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "b61a67e5afd98a41",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-rounded,  cc-border-right, cc-card-center, cc-card-gradient-0deg\n---\n\n[[Lesson 05 - Using Callout decorations.canvas|Next]]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 140,
      "x": -40,
      "y": 340
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "769759d2ec2b05e5",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-rounded,  cc-border-left, cc-card-center, cc-card-gradient-0deg\n---\n\n[[Lesson 03 - Try decorating a card for yourself.canvas|Previous]]",
